# Synced from vexouLuna/conventions: change it there, not here.
#
# LF everywhere, in the repo and in every checkout: the hooks and scripts are POSIX sh, and a CRLF
# checkout would break them. PowerShell scripts are the one exception and keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
